    "en": {
      "trackName": "Watch Chess",
      "description": "Watch Chess is the Next Generation of chess broadcasting!\n\nThis is the first chess app designed exclusively to provide the best experience on your mobile devices and Mac. It's also the first app designed for the Apple Watch, optimized for your wrist.\nThis app allows you to navigate through live and recent chess tournaments at the Grand Master level so that you can stay up to date on each round and each game.\n\nYou can also subscribe to notifications to learn about results in real time. You will receive a push notification at the beginning of each round, as well as after every individual game.\n\nThis is the *only* chess application that will provide you with live, up-to-the-minute notifications on all live chess action from top tournaments around the world.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Real time games from top chess tournaments in the world.\n• Optimized user experience so that you can navigate through the moves by simply swiping your finger.\n• Watch multiple games at once thanks to its extremely simple interface.\n• Subscribe to push notifications to get real time updates on all the games!\n• PRO only: real time engine analysis\n\n-------------\nHave questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you!\nYou can e-mail us at info@watchchessapp.com or tweet us at @watch_chess.\n-------------\n\nNote about subscriptions: they will automatically renew unless canceled within 24-hours before the end of the current period. You can cancel anytime with your iTunes account settings. Any unused portion of a free trial will be forfeited if you purchase a subscription. For more information, see our Terms of Service (https://watchchess.app/tos.html) and Privacy Policy (https://watchchess.app/privacy.html).",
      "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes and performance improvements",
