      "releaseNotes": "- Added ability to search for tournaments\n- Added ability to filter games\n- Engine settings allows you to change engine depth\n- Added ability to reload tournaments\n- Games will no longer be out of date when coming back from the background\n- Engine optimizations\n- Translated app into several languages, with more to come!",
